        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a leading player in the online recruitment industry, we face competition from providers of similar services.",
        "start_character": 47533,
        "end_character": 47644
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For enterprise users, we provide direct recruitment services that allow enterprise users to post jobs, receive personalized candidate recommendations, engage in direct communication and receive resumes upon mutual consent.",
        "start_character": 11595,
        "end_character": 11817
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we require them to provide additional materials, including industry service licenses, video of their office environment or conduct an in-person meeting with our offline risk assessment team.",
        "start_character": 28308,
        "end_character": 28511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For job seekers, we provide job seeking services that allow job seekers to receive job recommendations, initiate direct chats and deliver resumes upon mutual consent.",
        "start_character": 11344,
        "end_character": 11510
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Leveraging these data and technologies, we developed a more accurate portrait of each individual user and are able to understand user preferences to predict the likelihood of a successful job and candidate match indicated by the offering and acceptance of an interview invitation.",
        "start_character": 19585,
        "end_character": 19865
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To improve job-matching results, we offer paid value-added services, such as resume exposure booster, competitive candidate analysis and AI interview training, to help job seekers improve visibility, better prepare for their job hunt and assess their candidacy.",
        "start_character": 17693,
        "end_character": 17954
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also gather creative ideas from all of our teams, including service development team, sales team and big data and algorithm team who best understand user behavior and demand.",
        "start_character": 24692,
        "end_character": 24869
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete to attract, engage and retain users, to provide more accurate job and candidate matching and to improve and expand our product and service offerings in general.",
        "start_character": 47765,
        "end_character": 47936
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have established our Psychological Service Care Center (PSCC), which offers high-quality psychosomatic health services to all employees, including individual counseling sessions, management consultancy, customized departmental programs, leadership development courses, experiential group counseling activities, and specialized thematic events.",
        "start_character": 65180,
        "end_character": 65526
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide online recruitment services through our main mobile app BOSS Zhipin (BOSS 直聘).",
        "start_character": 11915,
        "end_character": 12004
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide recruitment and job hunting services to both enterprise users and job seekers and generate most of our revenue from paid services offered to enterprise users.",
        "start_character": 17037,
        "end_character": 17206
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-050959",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-050959-f4dde8a7425150ee",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-050959",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "●For enterprise users, we offer direct recruitment services that allow them to post jobs and communicate with job seekers, which can be free or paid based on an innovative connection-oriented monetization strategy, supplemented by paid value-added tools to further enhance their recruitment efficiency as part of our overall recruitment services to the enterprise users.",
